sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as MCP Client
    participant Surf as surf-mcp
    participant PW as Playwright
    participant Fara as Fara-7B

    Client->>Surf: act("click the search button")
    activate Surf

    Surf->>PW: screenshot()
    PW-->>Surf: PNG image

    Surf->>Fara: analyze(screenshot, goal)
    Note right of Fara: Visual grounding
    Fara-->>Surf: FaraToolCall
    Note over Surf: action: left_click<br/>coordinate: [624, 280]<br/>confidence: 0.92

    Surf->>PW: click(624, 280)
    PW-->>Surf: success

    Surf->>PW: screenshot()
    PW-->>Surf: PNG image

    deactivate Surf
    Surf-->>Client: Result + screenshot
